# mmsg get tag: a comma is a space, and a name of several words, a missing index and no words at all are answered each their way.
# ours: get tag takes the number as the last field, as macOS's monitor names have spaces (docs/afvigelser.md §3).
monitors 2
dispatch focusmon,HEADLESS-2
open n
dispatch focusmon,HEADLESS-1
open a
open b
dispatch @b tagsilent,2
get tag HEADLESS-1 2
get tag HEADLESS-1,1
get tag HEADLESS-1 10
get tag Other Display 1
ours error "invalid monitor or tag index"
get tag Other 1
get tag HEADLESS-1
get tag HEADLESS-2 1
get tag HEADLESS-2
get tag
